# skill-efficacy run records + report.md (#588): per-run, carry live-org GUIDs and the
# org machine fingerprint — never tracked. The trend lives in the guarded efficacy.md.
evals/skill/runs/

# paired-run results (#890, ADR 0028): per-run dirs carry live-org GUIDs + transcripts,
# so the whole tree is ignored EXCEPT the derived cross-run matrix.md. A reportable full
# run commits its named artifacts (run.json/trials.jsonl, and report.md once that
# generator lands) by explicit `git add -f` (which overrides this) — transcripts/run.log
# stay out only because they are never named.
evals/results/*
!evals/results/matrix.md

# brainstorming visual companion (transient)
.superpowers/

# Local e2e run logs (scripts/e2e_all.py)
/logs/

# Coverage report artifacts (CI generates these report-only; never tracked)
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.coverage
